   "start": 776.89,
   "end": 780.17,
   "text": "Based on before, so I'll just grow it out from there."
  },
  {
   "start": 781.17,
   "end": 785.45,
   "text": "Uh, Pliny also said that the circumference was 12.06 miles."
  },
  {
   "start": 785.45,
   "end": 788.85,
   "text": "Um, I think he said 13.5 Roman miles."
  },
  {
   "start": 789.63,
   "end": 793.55,
   "text": "A Roman mile is 90% of an English mile, um,"
  },
  {
   "start": 793.69,
   "end": 798.17,
   "text": "And, uh, the Aurelian wall is 12 miles."
  },
  {
   "start": 798.53,
   "end": 801.75,
   "text": "So, for some crazy-ass, somehow,"
  },
  {
   "start": 802.35,
   "end": 805.95,
   "text": "The Aurelian wall is, like, the same exact size"
  },
  {
   "start": 805.95,
   "end": 810.31,
   "text": "As the Vespasian wall in terms of how, what the circumference is."
  },
  {
   "start": 810.31,
   "end": 812.73,
   "text": "Um, and they have nothing to do with each other."
  },
  {
   "start": 813.25,
   "end": 817.69,
   "text": "Um, when Pliny said that, um,"
  },
  {
   "start": 818.83,
   "end": 820.27,
   "text": "There was no Aurelian wall."
  },
  {
   "start": 821.63,
   "end": 823.41,
   "text": "And then when they built the Aurelian wall,"
  },
  {
   "start": 823.49,
   "end": 825.63,
   "text": "They didn't do it based on how long Pliny said."
  },
  {
   "start": 825.77,
   "end": 829.45,
   "text": "They did it based on whatever wall they could build."
  },
  {
   "start": 829.65,
   "end": 830.95,
   "text": "And they built it in a hurry."
  },
  {
   "start": 831.65,
   "end": 833.43,
   "text": "They incorporated buildings into it,"
  },
  {
   "start": 833.71,
   "end": 835.39,
   "text": "Apartment buildings and, um,"
  },
  {
   "start": 836.47,
   "end": 838.69,
   "text": "The Pyramid of Cestius, and, um,"
  },
  {
   "start": 838.69,
   "end": 841.93,
   "text": "Just happened to be the same exact size."
  },
  {
   "start": 842.05,
   "end": 843.53,
   "text": "But if you look at the, uh,"
  },
  {
   "start": 845.33,
   "end": 847.39,
   "text": "Aurelian wall, it's, like, really jagged."
  },
  {
   "start": 848.05,
   "end": 851.25,
   "text": "And so, if you, you know,"
  },
  {
   "start": 851.29,
   "end": 852.29,
   "text": "Because I wanted to do this,"
  },
  {
